    "Real polygon_area(const Polygon& p) { return fabsl(polygon_signed_area2(p)) / 2; }",
    "// 機能: 多角形の全辺長を足して周長を返す。",
    "Real polygon_perimeter(const Polygon& p) {",
    "    Real ans = 0; int n = (int)p.size();",
